 "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled": true, "primaryGenreName": "Book", "primaryGenreId": 6018, "currentVersionReleaseDate": "2026-07-30T16:56:39Z", "version": "1.1.1", "wrapperType": "software", "currency": "KRW", "description": "DustJacket is the personal book tracker you've been looking for. It is simple, beautiful, and built around the way you actually read.\n\nWhether you're managing a growing physical library, tracking digital reads, or keeping a wish list of books to buy, DustJacket keeps everything organized in one place.\n\nTRACK YOUR LIBRARY\n- Mark books as Owned or on your Wish List\n- Track reading status: Want to Read, Currently Reading, Read, or Did Not Finish\n- Tag books as Physical, Digital, or Audiobook, or all three\n- Log purchase dates for your collection\n\nYOUR READING QUEUE\n- Build an ordered reading queue from any book in your library\n- Drag to reorder what's up next\n- Swipe to remove when you're done\n\nADD BOOKS INSTANTLY\n- Scan a barcode to look up any book automatically\n- Search by title or author to find and add books from Open Library's database of millions of titles\n- Add books manually when needed\n\nBEAUTIFUL SHELF VIEW\n- Browse your library as a cover grid, just like a real bookshelf\n- Cover art loads automatically for most books\n- Search and filter by status, reading state, or format\n\nSYNCS EVERYWHERE\n- iCloud sync keeps your library up to date across all your iPhone and iPad devices automatically\n\nDustJacket is simple by design. No social features, no algorithms, no noise. Just your books.", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 0, "trackCensoredName": "DustJacket", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/dustjacket/id6785198619?uo=4", "minimumOsVersion": "17.6", "userRatingCount": 0}]}